Z||000003||deceler8||03-13-2001||09:07 AM||||On the four cylinder engine, it's real easy to jar loose or knock off the speed sensor connector at the transaxle. I've done it just changing my oil filter.<P>So check that...may just be a loose connection.||||reg||1
